# UI Design System / UI デザインシステム

## Visual Identity / ビジュアルアイデンティティ

Regapro AI looks like **professional business software**, not a generative-AI demo.

### Color Tokens / カラートークン

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-accent` | `#0F766E` | Primary actions, active nav, links |
| `--color-bg` | `#F7F7F5` | App background |
| `--color-surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Panels, inputs, tables |
| `--color-text` | `#1F2937` | Body text |
| `--color-border` | `#E5E7EB` | Dividers, input borders |

### Forbidden Visual Patterns / 禁止パターン

- **No blue-purple gradients** — use flat surfaces and subtle borders.
- **No glow, glassmorphism, star/sparkle, or "AI magic" decorations.**
- **No large rounded card grids** (20px+ radius on panels, masonry KPI tiles).
- **No giant KPI cards** — metrics belong inline in context, not as hero widgets.
- **No huge page titles with long descriptions** — prefer compact headers; put detail in the body or help.

### Layout / レイアウト

- **Don't wrap everything in cards.** Use tables, lists, split panes, and inline sections.
- **Don't stack many equally-strong buttons.** One primary action per context; secondary actions as text links or icon buttons.
- Spacing scale: **8px base** (8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48).
- Border radius: **6–12px** for panels and inputs; never 20px+ for structural containers.
- Shadows: **only** for drawers, menus, modals, and popovers — not for every list item.

## Product Context Reminder / プロダクト文脈

This is a **business OS**, not a chat app. Screens show work in progress (案件、タスク、成果物), not conversation threads as the default layout.

Organize UI by **user work units**, not feature names. Never surface internal implementation names (Repository, Provider, Worker) to general users.

## Architecture Boundary / アーキテクチャ境界

UI components must **not** call Repository or Provider classes directly. All data access goes through the **Application Service** layer (server actions, route handlers, or typed client hooks that call services).

Never expose secrets, service role keys, or provider API keys to the client bundle.
